# Flattened variables build no node: their children join the nearest node
# around them. Start takes every Entry, Array every Item however long the
# list, and a Sum its whole chain of terms. Sum's hook runs on the Sum nodes
# that exist, never on a flattened continuation.
Start
| Entry Entries

Entries@<
| ";" Entry Entries
|

Entry
| Array
| "=" Sum

Array@!"]"^
| "[" Members

Members@<
| Item MembersTail "]"
| "]"

MembersTail@<
| "," Item MembersTail
|

Item
| Word
| Array

Sum@total
| Number "+" Sum@<
| Number

Word
| letter _Letters

_Letters
| letter _Letters
|

Number
| digit _Digits

_Digits
| digit _Digits
|
